This directory contains package.py, a local copy of the ufs-weather-model Spack recipe: https://github.com/spack/spack-packages/blob/develop/repos/spack_repo/builtin/packages/ufs_weather_model/package.py

It will not need frequent updates, but it is used by the GitHub Actions workflow under .github/workflows/Spack.yml. It only needs updates for changes to minimum version requirements, new dependencies, and new build options.
